function closeEditorNow(){if(!editorState&&!$('#editor').open)return;for(const off of editorState?.offs||[])try{off?.destroy?.();}catch{}editorState=null;editorError('');if($('#editor').open)$('#editor').close();delete $('#editor').dataset.type;}
